      "source": "<a href=\"../GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> representation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a>.<br/>\nCopied from Spring Data Mongodb, not derived from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a> as this conflicts with the already existing converter\nfor Point in <a href=\"../../convert/GeoConverters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.convert\"><code>GeoConverters</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../GeoJson.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo 中的接口\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> 格式的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a> 表示。<br/>\n此内容是从 Spring Data MongoDB 复制而来，而非从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a> 派生，因为这与 <a href=\"../../convert/GeoConverters.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.convert 中的类\"><code>GeoConverters</code></a> 中已存在的 Point 转换器存在冲突。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
